    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Came up on the Flats with nothing but nerve.</p><p><strong>Skills:</strong> choose 2 of: Stealth, Streetwise, Perception.</p><p><strong>Perk:</strong> one Perk (suggested: intrigue).</p><p><strong>Inciting Incident (d6):</strong></p><ol><li>You ran a message through six blocks of hostile turf and never dropped it.</li><li>A fixer bailed you out of a Sinks lockup and now owns a piece of you.</li><li>You boosted your first rig off a corp courier before you were old enough to drive it.</li><li>Your crew got burned by a snitch, and you are the only one who walked away clean.</li><li>You traded a favor to a street doc for patchwork chrome you still cannot fully explain.</li><li>A Halo-side job went bad and left you owing someone far above your station.</li></ol>",
